{"asset_key":"ep4/herohub_story_14411270","episode":"ep4","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"14411270","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1441127001:0":{"text":"사리에 님이 저를 지상으로 보낸 건 아마도 제가 입 밖으로 꺼낸 “진실”을 직접 확인하게 하기 위해서겠지요.","source_cn":"沙利叶让我前往地表的目的，或许是为了验证我说出口的“真相”。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BDD35C411A6CAC6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1441127002:0":{"text":"제가 죄악화의 흔적 없이 돌아올 수 있었다는 사실만으로도 저의 저주가 풀렸다는 것을 증명합니다. 여왕은 거짓말을 한거지요.","source_cn":"我能够没有孽化迹象地回来，就向世人证明了我的诅咒已经解...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D819960800A74FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1441127003:0":{"text":"...우리 모두 태양 아래에서 바람과 이슬을 맞으며 자유롭게 살아갈 수 있다는 증거입니다.","source_cn":"——证明我们本可以自由地生活在阳光下，沐浴微风和雨露。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x365B1195E5E087A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1441127004:0":{"text":"수천 년동안 에세일에게 내려온 저주를... 끊어낼 때가 왔습니다. ","source_cn":"艾塞勒血脉中延续千年的诅咒……到了挣脱的时候了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98FB005B9D515235","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:因度厄":{"text":"인듀어","source":"因度厄","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}